### C.jet_elements_annex_context_exec.ah_readBit_funct
ah_readBit_funct
     : @eq (option Clight.fundef)
         (@Globalenvs.Genv.find_funct Clight.fundef Ctypes.type
            (Clight.genv_genv jet_elements_support_sha_linkage.sha_ge)
            (Values.Vptr (jet_elements_support_sha_linkage.sha_symbol_block jets_elements._readBit)
